== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} The Turdlings are much less common than their counterparts, spawning only 1/4th as often.
* {{dlc+|r+}} {{i|Flush!}} kills Turdlings instantly and causes them to leave behind 6 {{e|Dip}}s each.{{dlc-}}

== Trivia ==
* They are a corny poop-themed variant of the {{e|Gurglings}}.
** {{Dlc|r}} Unlike the {{e|Gurglings}}, their sprite was not updated for Repentence.
* The Turdlings and their regular variant, the Gurglings, spawn in groups of three during the Boss Rush.

